{"server":"en","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_08_end","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_08","title":"Siesta Rhapsody","storyCode":"OF-8","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"62be42f81c20cbe78e44e4b3f1fc6d3e53b4483cd7ae2a45d4ae8962f0645700","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"Haah!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"Hyah!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Is it really getting weaker? I can't tell from the appearance at all!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"Watch out for the lava! Just how much obsidian has this thing absorbed?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Giant Originium Slug","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"GROOOAAAAARRRRR!!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"Poor thing... But we can't afford to show it any mercy! Skyfire!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"All right, I got it! Time to go all out!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"Well then, how do you like the taste of this?!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Giant Originium Slug","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Grooooooarrr!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"It's becoming enraged...! I'll block its way. The rest of you, focus on attacking!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"Big tail!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"I finally managed to land a hit through a crack in the lava, but I can't guarantee that it's going to work on something of this size!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Giant Originium Slug","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——————!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"We did it! It's heading the other way!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"Yes! The citizens are going to be safe now!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"Good grief! I can't believe a single slug would be that hard to deal with! My skirt is all ruined..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"It was the leader of the colony after all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"If people didn't destroy their habitat in the first place, then perhaps..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"I'm exhausted! Let's not bring up that tiresome topic again!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Haha, me too. I'm so tired I can barely stand."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"But, we have to head back to Siesta. There are people waiting for us there..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Oof!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"That's understandable, but a mature lady should also learn to get help if she's not even able to keep her balance."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ceylon","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"Th-thank you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"All right, let's go take our victory lap now. Once we get back, there might still be some time for us to enjoy our vacation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"But... sooner or later, this place will..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"Big tail?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"Ah, I'm coming."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Provence","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"Skyfire..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"I know."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Skyfire","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"But we should respect the city's choice, and let them handle the rest, right?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["Provence"]},{"speakerId":"char_166_skfire","aliases":["Skyfire"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["Ceylon"]}]}
